Description: GStreamer libav plugins
 GStreamer is a streaming media framework, based on graphs of filters
 which operate on media data.  Its plugin-based architecture means that
 new data types or processing capabilities can be added simply by
 installing new plug-ins.
 .
 This package contains the libav plugins, which wrap the FFmpeg
 libraries: the encoders and decoders (avenc_*, avdec_*), the audio and
 video converters and scalers built on libavfilter, and the subtitles.
 Together with the ffmpeg library of this repository they give GStreamer
 a wide range of format and codec support.
 .
 This build has no X11 support: the X11 video sinks of the "good" set are
 not built, so this plugin does not depend on libxkbcommon-x11-0 and does
 not pull the outdated libxkbcommon 1.7.0-2 from trixie.
